Fixed all five findings in `src/lsp.rs`:

- Assignment/range `to` no longer opens a literal frame.
- Object member access resolves in the deferred pass, including forward references and `this.field`.
- Lexer failures now include their source span.
- Completions treat the opening quote and first `/` of `//` as inside text/comment.
- Builtin references exclude member-access and type-annotation names.

Added 6 regression tests covering each finding.

